<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>MLX on Ricky</title><link>https://linzeyan.github.io/zh-tw/tags/mlx/</link><description>Recent content in MLX on Ricky</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-tw</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 10:46:55 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://linzeyan.github.io/zh-tw/tags/mlx/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Local LLM on MacBookPro - Audio/Video</title><link>https://linzeyan.github.io/zh-tw/posts/2026/20260731-local-llm-audio-video/</link><pubDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 10:46:55 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://linzeyan.github.io/zh-tw/posts/2026/20260731-local-llm-audio-video/</guid><description>&lt;h3 id="video">Video&lt;/h3>
